{
    "title": "Warriors and Adventure",
    "description": "\"Warriors and adventure\" grand opening!\r\nHere, the vast map is open for you to explore. You can be a brave warrior, a mysterious mage, or a holy and noble Taoist priest!\r\n\r\nHere, you don't need to fight manually. You can automatically challenge by placing it, free your hands, and challenge easily!\r\n\r\nHere, skills can be matched at will. Attributes can be refined as you wish. Legendary heroes are under your imagination!\r\n\r\nHere, you can meet friends from all over the world. And start a 3V3 combat together! Fight against the invasion of monsters together and grab abundant rewards!\r\n\r\nInfinite excitement is waiting for you, don't miss it!\r\n\r\nFeatured gameplay:\r\n1. Challenge BOSS: BOSS is coming. We will stop them and claim its loots!\r\n2. Bichon Mine: AFK Mining system. Dig it when you are free. Easily increase your combat power!\r\n3. Ladder Hall: The challenge is unlimited. Higher combat power grants higher floors!\r\n4. Demon Invasion: Guard the Marfa Continent and fight against the invasion of monsters!\r\n5. Shadow forest: The mysterious forest, full of unknowns, might bring you different surprises and treasures!",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Warriors and adventure&quot; grand opening!<br>Here, the vast map is open for you to explore. You can be a brave warrior, a mysterious mage, or a holy and noble Taoist priest!<br><br>Here, you don&#39;t need to fight manually. You can automatically challenge by placing it, free your hands, and challenge easily!<br><br>Here, skills can be matched at will. Attributes can be refined as you wish. Legendary heroes are under your imagination!<br><br>Here, you can meet friends from all over the world. And start a 3V3 combat together! Fight against the invasion of monsters together and grab abundant rewards!<br><br>Infinite excitement is waiting for you, don&#39;t miss it!<br><br>Featured gameplay:<br>1. Challenge BOSS: BOSS is coming. We will stop them and claim its loots!<br>2. Bichon Mine: AFK Mining system. Dig it when you are free. Easily increase your combat power!<br>3. Ladder Hall: The challenge is unlimited. Higher combat power grants higher floors!<br>4. Demon Invasion: Guard the Marfa Continent and fight against the invasion of monsters!<br>5. Shadow forest: The mysterious forest, full of unknowns, might bring you different surprises and treasures!",
